{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"lizang-e-o136","title":"许褚众少不敌力战兵矢尽，令壁中聚治石，飞石掷贼所值摧碎，贼不敢进","accounts":[{"id":"lizang-a-1b3f163f8cbebc0914e1","label":"正文","text":"许褚众少不敌力战兵矢尽，令壁中聚治石，飞石掷贼所值摧碎，贼不敢进","evidence":["lizang-q-584189f0683a129fe756"]},{"id":"lizang-a-de9106b6d7ab21ea9e91","label":"正文","text":"粮乏伪与贼和以牛易食，褚出阵前一手逆曳牛尾行百余步，贼众惊不敢取牛而走","evidence":["lizang-q-23516ccba03b3c02f2a4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0015","role":"飞石退贼；曳牛尾却贼","evidence":["lizang-q-584189f0683a129fe756","lizang-q-23516ccba03b3c02f2a4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["lizang-q-584189f0683a129fe756","lizang-q-23516ccba03b3c02f2a4"]},"ordering_evidence":"lizang-q-584189f0683a129fe756","source_order":[18,130,71],"order":3673}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0015","name":"许褚","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"lizang-q-23516ccba03b3c02f2a4","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a88d5bb91f31d43a23a4","layer":"original","quote":"粮乏，伪与贼和，以牛与贼易食；贼来取牛，牛辄奔还。褚乃出阵前，一手逆曳牛尾，行百余步。贼众惊，遂不敢取牛而走","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":130,"end":184,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-584189f0683a129fe756","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a88d5bb91f31d43a23a4","layer":"original","quote":"褚众少不敌，力战疲极〖3〗，兵矢尽；乃令壁中男女，聚治石如杅斗者置四隅〖4〗。褚飞石掷之，所值皆摧碎〖5〗；贼不敢进","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":71,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
